s the originator of the transaction. Please indicate your interest to the above email address interest and to let you know the next step of action towards the success of this transaction. Reply me on this email:David_smith9@myway.com Best regards, MR. DAVID SMITH The information in this letter is confidential, please, if you are not interested destroy this message, You should not retain copy or use this letter for any purpose, nor disclose all or any part of its content to",d06,Employment and Recruitment,"GENERAL SETTINGS
