ard it to the bank for open of account with them for you so that they can transfer the fund through telegraphic wire transfer to your nominated account in your country. We NEED YOUR FULL NAME, YOUR ADDRESS AND TELEPHONE NUMBER AND FAX. THIS WILL ENABLE US TO PROCEED FOR THE OPEN OF ACCOUNT IN YOUR Favor AS THE NEW BENEFICIARY OF THE FUND. LORD BE WITH YOU ALL Regard Selina&Gabriel Marinze------------------------------------------Faites un over et pews Voilà ! www.voila.fr ",d11,Education and Training,"GENERAL SETTINGS
