ransferred to your account. Further information and arrangement will commence as soon as trust, confidence and good relationship is established. I shall be most grateful if you maintain the confidentiality required in this transaction. Do not hesitate to call me on my phone for further directives or send me email to enable us commence towards the conclusion of this transaction. I await for your prompt response. Thanks and God bless, MRS.MARIA BAND For the Family 		---------------------------------Yahoo! for Good Click here to donate to the Hurricane Katrina relief effort. ",d12,Travel and Transportation,"GENERAL SETTINGS
