 the successful transferring of these fund to your nominated account overseas. Please I will be very happy if this transaction will be concluded with in seven (7)working days from now. I am expecting to hear from you as soon as possible. May Almighty God bless you as you do care for me Amen. Best regardEvette Wuhan Vase",d12,Travel and Transportation,"GENERAL SETTINGS
