posit which is the only hope of our survival out from the security company and to stand as my family foreign partner/beneficiary and subsequently transfer this money into your account in your country and finally make arrangement for our travelling documents to your country after you have helped us received the money to your position. I have all the necessary documents covering the deposit in the security and finance company with my name as the next of kin. I am anxiously waiting for your urgent response. My Best regards, Langley Williams",d16,Entertainment and Leisure,"GENERAL SETTINGS
